# ---- after the restructure ----
# logging/ holds runtime state (JSON stores, message archives, member bot data,
# dev-server logs) and is ignored. The one file that must survive a deploy is
# the GitHub sync allow-list, so it is re-included explicitly.
!logging/github_settings.json
logging/memberbot_data/
logging/message_logs/
logging/deleted_logs/
logging/*.log
logging/*.log.err
logging/run.md
